"xquz4c\"}]],\"className\":\"lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/15 py-7 lg:border-t-0 lg:px-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#78858a]\",\"children\":\"真实系统\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"DCF Quantum\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9ca7aa]\",\"children\":\"一套能在本机运行的三情景 DCF 筛选器：把数据口径、缓存、运行清单和 Windows 交付放在同一条研究流程里。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#3dff8f]\",\"children\":[\"REV \",2,\" / \",\"核验\",\" \",\"2026-08-27\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"hidden items-center justify-center border-x border-white/10 text-[#f4d431] lg:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$21:props:children:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:children:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/15 py-7 lg:border-t-0 lg:pl-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#78858a]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2\",\"key\":\"8i5ue5\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2\",\"key\":\"1b9ql8\"}],[\"line\",{\"x1\":\"8\",\"x2\":\"16\",\"y1\":\"12\",\"y2\":\"12\",\"key\":\"1jonct\"}]],\"className\":\"lucide-link2 lucide-link-2 h-4 w-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\" \",\"证据与复现\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 border-t border-white/10\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$L26\",\"note-/notes/deterministic-core-ai-edge\",{\"href\":\"/notes/deterministic-core-ai-edge\",\"className\":\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5 border-b border-white/10 py-4 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff]\",\"children\":\"$L29\"}],\"$L2a\",\"$L2b\",\"$L2c\"],[\"$L2d\",\"$L2e\",\"$L2f\",\"$L30\"],[\"$L31\"]]}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[#080a0c]\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"principle\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 border-b border-white/12 px-5 py-20 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":\"01 / 原则\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-5 block h-px w-16 bg-[#24e0ff]\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] text-white md:text-6xl\",\"children\":\"估值必须能被复算。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"cstd-mdx-prose cstd-mdx-prose-dark\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"软件不调用大模型，也不自动交易。悲观、中性和乐观区间由公开、确定性的 Python 公式产生，并保留实际折现率口径。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"我做这个工具的出发点很简单：同一家公司换一台电脑、换一次运行时间，不应该因为页面重新组织了一下就得到另一套数学。用户可以调整假设，但每个输入都要有明确含义，结果也要能回到公式和数据。它不是替人做投资决定，而是把研究过程从黑盒里拿出来。\"}]]}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"audit\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 border-b border-white/12 px-5 py-20 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":\"02 / 审计\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-5 block h-px w-16 bg-[#24e0ff]\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] text-white md:text-6xl\",\"children\":\"每次扫描都有数据血缘。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"cstd-mdx-prose cstd-mdx-prose-dark\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"运行清单记录模型版本、配置哈希、数据指纹、缓存参数、依赖版本与输出哈希。代理结果与已完成 FCFF 桥接的确认结果明确分离。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"“代理”在这里不是一个模糊的免责声明，而是产品里的真实状态。缺少足够财务数据时，系统可以告诉用户目前能算到哪一步，但不能把估算包装成已经确认的 FCFF。清单把这层差别留下来，后续更新数据时也能知道哪些结果值得重算。\"}]]}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"desktop\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-24 border-b border-white/12 px-5 py-20 md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":\"03 / 交付\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"mt-5 block h-px w-16 bg-[#24e0ff]\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] text-white md:text-6xl\",\"children\":\"把研究内核交付给没有 Python 的电脑。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"cstd-mdx-prose cstd-mdx-prose-dark\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Windows x64 安装包包含本地浏览器 GUI、独立工作进程、安全取消和离线体验；服务只监听本机回环地址。\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"桌面交付的难点不只是把 Python 打成一个 exe。启动、取消、缓存目录、错误提示和没有网络时的行为都要在最终机器上试过。把服务限制在回环地址，是因为这个工具的目标是本机研究，不需要把数据接口暴露到局域网。\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]],\"\\n\",null]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b border-[#f4d431]/40 bg-[#f4d431] px-5 py-20 text-[#050709] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1